Error [E0326]: This pattern leaves out fields of `Rect`: h
  --> named_pattern_missing_field.jet:8:9
    |
  8 |         .Rect{w} -> w
    |         ^^^^^^^^
 Why: A pattern that doesn't name every field must end with `..` so the skipped fields are visible at a glance
 Fix: Add `, ..` before the closing `}`, or name h
